[1;33;40m  ---> Define a four-dimensional manifold with a positive-definite (Euclidean) metric.[0m


[1;33;40m  ---> Define the clock field on the Euclidean manifold.[0m


[1;33;40m  ---> Define the scalar functions G4(X_E) and K(X_E) which parameterise the gravitational action.[0m


