[1;33;40m   ### Riemannian gravity Lagrangian (Eq. 3.6 of 1301.1361)[0m


[1;33;40m  ---> The kinetic scalar of the clock field is X_E = g_E^{ab} nabla_a phi nabla_b phi.[0m
